&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As Staff Engineer, you&#39;ll own the architecture, agents and skills that let every builder in your tribe ship sound, well-architected work without waiting on a handoff, at a moment when Mews has moved almost entirely to an agentic-first engineering model. The problem this role exists to solve is easy to state and hard to do: most technical decisions now get made by builders and the agents they run, not by senior engineers in review, so the standard has to be built into the tooling itself or the gaps show up in what customers touch. Mews is rebuilding hospitality software from the ground up at a genuinely unusual pace, which makes this one of the few staff engineering roles where the leverage you build gets used by everyone around you within weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be attached to one tribe, reporting into its Director, and working alongside other staff engineers, staff product managers and staff designers across your division. Your job isn&#39;t to ship features. It&#39;s to produce the architecture, agents and skills that give every builder in the tribe the context to make sound calls on their own, and to stay hands-on with the hardest problems yourself: the gnarly migrations and system-wide refactors that need an approach invented rather than executed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Mews moves builders to own a sub-metric end-to-end, with AI covering what they&#39;re lighter in, the risk isn&#39;t slower shipping, it&#39;s the architecture fragmenting underneath the speed. This role exists so the foundations get stronger as the tribe ships faster, not shakier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you would do&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the tribe&#39;s engineering context, agents and skills, and be accountable for keeping them coherent, current and grounded in real product work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evaluate the internal engineering agents and skills that Product Builders use daily, encoding architectural standards, review logic and quality gates directly into the tools they run&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend and improve the tribe&#39;s agentic tooling when it isn&#39;t good enough yet, since agentic development is the default way you build, not a fallback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay hands-on with the hardest technical problems: gnarly migrations, system-wide refactors and architecture calls that will shape years of future building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;When work ships off-bar, trace it back to what was missing in the agents or patterns and fix it at the root so the same class of miss doesn&#39;t recur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency Level 4:&lt;/strong&gt; in this role that means building and shipping the engineering agents and skills that Product Builders rely on every day, not just using AI tools yourself. You need enough understanding of the underlying models and infrastructure to make real engineering decisions about them, because the agents you build become part of the tribe&#39;s production system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For more information on AI fluency at Mews, please refer to &quot;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mews.atlassian.net/wiki/external/YWI5ZGUyMGQ3MjU2NGRmNjlkZGEyYTg2NTVmZGE0OTU&quot;&gt;AI Fluency at Mews: A Comprehensive Guide for Candidates&lt;/a&gt;&quot; on Confluence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you would bring&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record as a senior or staff-level engineer who has shipped and owned complex systems at scale, not just contributed to them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience turning hard-won technical judgment into reusable architecture, tooling or standards that other engineers actually adopt, rather than documentation that goes unused&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort holding a multi-cycle technical view (migrations, refactors, architecture decisions that play out over years) while still being able to drop into what needs to ship today&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication across levels: builders, your Director, Principals and, when it counts, the C-suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Fluency Level 4 or the equivalent hands-on experience: you&#39;ve shipped something where AI is a core component and can make engineering decisions about the underlying models and infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in hospitality, travel or another operationally complex B2B SaaS environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of coaching or multiplying other engineers&#39; output, not just your own&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Public writing or speaking about technical work you&#39;ve shipped&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Spain&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€79.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€100.500 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Czechia&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 491 000 Kč&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2 005 000 Kč CZK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£81,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£106,500 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Ireland&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€91.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€107.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude tokens, so you can automate workflows and build smarter, more efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive additional benefits that vary by location, from healthcare and retirement plans to team events, socials and other perks. Ask us about it during your interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer. We value teams that reflect the diversity of the customers and communities we serve. Different perspectives make better ideas, stronger products and a more welcoming company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also believe transparency is important when deciding if you&#39;re the right fit. Mews is an ambitious, high-pressure environment of continuous learning and high standards. Success here requires resilience, adaptability and a willingness to solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things that define how we work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy means high responsibility. People are expected to take ownership and drive outcomes. There isn’t a detailed playbook for everything, and that’s part of what makes the work challenging – and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change is constant. We’re growing quickly and adapting as we scale. Teams, processes and priorities continue to evolve, and only people who stay curious and agile will thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re remote-first, not relationship-free. Flexibility is core to how we work, but strong relationships still matter. Our teams are global, so we need expert collaborators and communicators to help us move forward together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is an integral part of our processes. It’s not here to steal people’s jobs, but to amplify efficiency and productivity. We’re motivated to proactively use the technology to seek out better ways of working and share our findings with the rest of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to support you during the application process, let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One final thing: don&#39;t hold back. If you don&#39;t meet 100% of the criteria in this job description but you&#39;re certain you could make a big impact, apply. Everyone should have equal access to opportunities, and we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If Mews sounds like the kind of environment where you&#39;d thrive, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic, we&#39;re revolutionising the way people buy groceries with our affordable and sustainable grocery service. In the Personalization team, you’ll build the experimentation platform that lets Picnic try new ideas safely and at scale: from which promotions to highlight to which emails to send. Your work lets business teams run experiments and control the customer experience themselves, without needing an engineer for every change. It’s a product that is foundational to our business, and it directly improves how customers shop every day. &lt;br&gt;We use React, React Native and TypeScript across the board, together with&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.picnic.nl/faster-features-happier-customers-introducing-the-platform-that-transformed-our-grocery-app-b38e57a85531&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;our server-driven UI framework&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; and we’re working towards a single platform for mobile and web.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think like a product owner.&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t just implement requirements, you question them. Together with product owners and designers, you shape specifications for new features, discuss trade-offs, push back when something doesn’t add up, and help build a long-term vision for where the platform should go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build bridges.&lt;/strong&gt; You work with cross-functional teams across the whole business: the business teams who rely on the platform, fellow engineers, and the other consumer-facing teams whose features run through it. You make it easy for others to succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive things forward.&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t wait for someone to hand you the next task. You spot what could be better, in the codebase, the platform or how the team works, and you take the lead on fixing it. You’ll take on increasingly challenging projects with full ownership of your contributions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; React, React Native, TypeScript and RxJS, Redux, Styled Components, Jest, Storybook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want ownership, real influence on product direction, and to see your work reach millions of customers, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;We’re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of building and shipping frontend applications end-to-end. You’ve taken products from idea to millions of users, and you’ve stayed around to make them better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong conceptual thinker. You thrive in ambiguity and lead the way to the right solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp judgement on trade-offs. You know when to build it right and when to ship it now, and you make that call yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real curiosity about the customer. You care whether your work changes how people shop, not just whether the code is clean.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, structured communicator. You collaborate effectively with product, design, backend, analytics, and frontend teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine motivation to build consumer and e-commerce experiences used by millions, with willingness to work from&lt;strong class=&quot;text-green1 list-item-text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Picnic’s Amsterdam office-first environment&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✍🏼Every expert was once a beginner!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get plenty of opportunities to challenge yourself and grow, including the Picnic Tech Academy, Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions, and tailored soft skills training. We also offer free professional weekly language courses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💡Make a difference&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🫱🏼‍🫲🏾Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍎You are what you eat&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get freshly prepared, healthy lunches and snacks (with plenty of vegetarian, vegan, and halal options). Coffee snob? Don’t worry, our amazing Picnic barista has you covered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚴🏽Stay healthy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga, to climbing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔋Attractive package&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer competitive compensation and a pension plan that looks out for your future self, as well as 25 vacation days per year, so you can recharge your batteries&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍Benefits for expats&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It can be daunting starting a new job AND moving to a new country. That’s why we offer lots of support for our many expat colleagues, if you want to find our relocation benefits, see&lt;a href=&quot;https://jobs.picnic.app/en/relocation&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Telnyx&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Telnyx is an industry leader that&#39;s not just imagining the future of global connectivity—we&#39;re building it. From architecting and amplifying the reach of a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://telnyx.com/our-network&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;private, global, multi-cloud IP network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, to bringing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://telnyx.com/resources/about-edge-connectivity&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;hyperlocal edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; technology right to your fingertips through intuitive APIs, we&#39;re shaping a new era of seamless interconnection between people, devices, and applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re driven by a desire to transform and modernize what&#39;s antiquated, automate the manual, and solve real-world problems through innovative connectivity solutions. As a testament to our success, we&#39;re proud to stand as a financially stable and profitable company. Our robust profitability allows us not only to invest in pioneering technologies but also to foster an environment of continuous learning and growth for our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our collective vision is a world where borderless connectivity fuels limitless innovation. By joining us, you can be part of laying the foundations for this interconnected future. We&#39;re currently seeking passionate individuals who are excited about the opportunity to contribute to an industry-shaping company while growing their own skills and careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most sales roles chase new logos. This one unlocks the revenue already inside Telnyx&#39;s customer base — and there&#39;s a lot of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Growth Account Executive (Expansion)&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll take commercial ownership of established Telnyx customers after their first 12 months, identifying and closing new revenue opportunities across our product portfolio, from Voice AI and programmable communications to messaging, connectivity, and AI infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own an assigned portfolio of existing customers, identify untapped opportunities, build relationships with new stakeholders, and drive expansion from prospecting through close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t traditional account management. You&#39;re not here to simply maintain relationships or renew contracts. You&#39;re here to grow accounts by introducing new products, expanding into new business units and geographies, and helping customers build more with Telnyx.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re not farming. You&#39;re hunting inside the base.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and grow your accounts.&lt;/strong&gt; Take commercial ownership of an assigned portfolio of established customers, developing strategies to drive incremental recurring revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find untapped opportunities.&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze customer usage, product adoption, business models, and growth plans to identify opportunities for cross-selling, upselling, and geographic expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hunt within existing accounts.&lt;/strong&gt; Run targeted, personalized outbound campaigns to engage new stakeholders, departments, and decision-makers within your customer portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the expansion sales cycle.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead discovery, qualify opportunities, develop commercial proposals, negotiate terms, and close expansion deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sell across the Telnyx product portfolio.&lt;/strong&gt; Identify opportunities spanning Voice AI, SIP trunking, programmable voice, messaging, WhatsApp Business, global numbers, wireless, and AI infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build strategic relationships.&lt;/strong&gt; Develop connections with technical buyers, business leaders, and economic decision-makers to uncover new use cases and accelerate adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive measurable revenue growth.&lt;/strong&gt; Own an incremental MRR target, focusing on commercially attributable, profitable expansion rather than organic usage growth alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across teams.&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Hunter AEs during account transitions and partner with Solutions Engineering, Customer Success, and Product teams to execute expansion strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own your forecast.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain accurate opportunities, account plans, and forecasts in Salesforce, ensuring clear visibility into pipeline health and commercial progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring customer intelligence back to Telnyx.&lt;/strong&gt; Share market insights, product feedback, and emerging customer requirements to help shape our roadmap and go-to-market strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in B2B technology sales, ideally as an Account Executive, Growth AE, or in a commercially focused business development role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated ability to generate pipeline through proactive outbound prospecting rather than relying exclusively on inbound demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hunter mentality and the commercial curiosity to identify opportunities that aren&#39;t immediately obvious.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong discovery and consultative selling skills, with the ability to connect technical capabilities to measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating multiple stakeholders and building relationships with both technical and commercial decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to independently manage opportunities, develop business cases, and move deals through a structured sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong account research and strategic thinking skills, including identifying whitespace and opportunities for cross-selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort discussing technical products with developers, engineering teams, operations leaders, and executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing pipeline and forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, accountable mindset with a genuine desire to own and deliver revenue results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in CPaaS, UCaaS, telecom, cloud infrastructure, AI, or developer-focused technology platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Voice AI, SIP trunking, programmable communications, WhatsApp Business API, or messaging infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous success in an expansion, cross-sell, upsell, or account-growth role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling multiple products or solutions into the same organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with MEDDPICC or another structured qualification methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with international or multinational customers across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Telnyx customers are already building on our infrastructure, but many are only using a fraction of what our platform can offer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A customer using us for SIP trunking might be a strong fit for Voice AI. A business operating in one country might be ready to expand across Europe. These opportunities don&#39;t always arrive as inbound requests. Someone needs to uncover them, build the business case, and turn them into revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&#39;s where you come in. You&#39;ll work on a warm base with real relationships, real usage data, and real expansion potential. The upside is there. You just have to go and find it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be measured on the incremental revenue you create, not simply the accounts you inherit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Telnyx&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real technology, built in-house.&lt;/strong&gt; We own our global network and build our communications and AI infrastructure, giving you a differentiated platform to sell.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A broad portfolio with real cross-sell potential.&lt;/strong&gt; From global connectivity and programmable communications to Voice AI and AI infrastructure, there&#39;s always another customer challenge we can solve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profitable and independent.&lt;/strong&gt; Join a company focused on sustainable growth and long-term investment in its technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;#LI-RH1&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
